      "body": "- Nixpkgs expects to drop support for intel macs in 26.11 as per Nixpkgs 25.11 [release notes](https://nixos.org/manual/nixpkgs/stable/release-notes#sec-nixpkgs-release-25.11-highlights).                          \r\n- It was [decided](https://input-output-rnd.slack.com/archives/CG1FBSDMM/p1776704401411139?thread_ts=1776677872.325309&cid=CG1FBSDMM) to no longer build x86_64-darwin on [ci.iog.io](https://ci.iog.io) to reduce strain on the struggling mac builders.\r\n- Add support for aarch64-darwin instead as otherwise mac would no longer be targeted at all.",
      "closed_at": null,
